  "_comment": "BasicMathKids (kids shell) screenshot capture: 11 distinct gameplay boards (counting, blocks, ten-frame, bead frame, number line, comparing), each a different question seed and a cycled theme (mint / peach / night). No home menu, sticker book, parent area, gate or reveal popup in any slot. _setup_taps unlocks full_pack (no banner, levels up to 20), mutes the voice, seeds skill levels and stickers. Boards are opened with KIDS.go('play', params); small DOM taps put blocks / counters / hops mid-way.",
